flowchart TB
    U[Human] --> D[Discord / Agentik UI / API]
    D --> HG[Hermes Gateway / API]
    HG --> HS[Hermes Session]
    HS --> ND[Nano Director Profile]

    ND --> DT[delegate_task]
    ND --> M[AGK Mission]
    M --> K[Hermes Root Kanban Task]
    K --> DAG[Kanban DAG]
    DAG --> W[Worker Profiles / Subagents]

    W --> SK[Skills / Ponytail]
    W --> MCP[Toolsets / MCP / Plugins]
    W --> WS[Projects / Worktrees / Sandbox]

    AGK[AGK Desired State / Policies] --> NC[Agentik Node Controller]
    NC --> HP[Hermes Config / Profiles]
    NC --> DP[Discord Provisioner]
    NC --> REG[Org + OS Registry]
    NC --> CAP[Capability Policy]

    DP --> D
    CAP --> MCP
    K --> EV[Evidence Hooks]
    MCP --> EV
    EV --> AO[Agentik Observability / Evals]
